{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"114225","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/114225","key":"MC-236682","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"15/Sep/21 12:16 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p><b>The Bug:</b></p>\n\n<p>Large and continuous lag spikes sometimes occur when loading/reloading into a world in 21w37a.</p>\n\n<p>This issue did not occur in 1.17.1. This may be quite difficult to reproduce as this does not happen all of the time.</p>\n\n<p><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Create a new world in 21w37a.</li>\n\t<li>Exit the world.</li>\n\t<li>Join the world again.</li>\n\t<li>→&nbsp;<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\">&nbsp;Notice how large and continuous lag spikes sometimes occur when loading/reloading into a world in 21w37a.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p><b>Expected Behavior:</b></p>\n\n<p>The expected behavior would be that no large and continuous lag spikes would sometimes occur when loading/reloading into a world in 21w37a.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"15/Sep/21 7:58 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/151777","id":"151777","filename":"2021-09-16_21_16_39-21w37a-21w37a.zip","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/60bfe4e2c90cb200683113e3/a59781d1-0534-49ca-90ad-39bae706c3c8/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/60bfe4e2c90cb200683113e3/a59781d1-0534-49ca-90ad-39bae706c3c8/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.n